  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: off-by-one heap buffer overflow in the YCbCr 4:2:0 to RGB\n     converter\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2021-3575.patch: in src/bin/common/color.c, bound the\n       trailing odd-row loop of sycc420_to_rgb() by loopmaxw instead of maxw and\n       consume the first column with Cb/Cr = 0 when x0 is odd, so the chroma\n       planes are no longer read one sample past their end.\n     - CVE-2021-3575",
